WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.007
Before pivoting admissions, inspect the source rows first.

00:00:04.007 --> 00:00:06.662
Each row represents one admission.

00:00:06.662 --> 00:00:11.092
Diagnosis is stored as a value in the diagnosis column.

00:00:11.092 --> 00:00:15.427
Later, the pivot will create separate diagnosis columns.

00:00:15.427 --> 00:00:20.747
That query is much easier to understand after you understand the long source.

00:00:20.747 --> 00:00:24.329
Always inspect the source grain before you reshape it.
